ifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misofoundations\/misowcag21ratio","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio","title":"MISOWCAG21Ratio"},"doc://MISOFoundations/documentation/MISOFoundations/MISOUserInterfaceSizeClass":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOUserInterfaceSizeClass","abstract":[{"text":"Enumerates the size classes defined by the design system.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"extraCompact","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" size class if for screens with width < 389.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"compact"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"regular","type":"text"}]},{"text":" size classes are the standard Apple classes.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOUserInterfaceSizeClass","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOUserInterfaceSizeClass","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misofoundations\/misouserinterfacesizeclass","title":"MISOUserInterfaceSizeClass","kind":"symbol"}}}